# Reconciliation Triage Practice

Manual-first reconciliation triage learning prototype using synthetic invoice and bank-statement data.

This project is built locally first and will only move to AWS after the required local tests and GitHub CI gates pass.

The system does not connect to real banks, transfer money, post accounting entries, or automatically approve financial actions.

AI is restricted to bounded exception classification and optional explanation of already-validated results.

## Development Status

Initial project skeleton established.

Development will follow a local-first workflow. AWS deployment will be introduced only after local tests and GitHub CI gates pass.

